message: "If you use givemotion in your work, you can cite it like this."
title: "givemotion"
abstract: "A free, open-source (MIT) video engine built for AI agents: the agent writes a video as HTML, CSS and JavaScript, checks its own frames and renders it deterministically, so edits change only what was asked."
type: software
